#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:3 5da992946eb3492c85cb226a4aef878f
msgid "Node"
msgstr "節點"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:9 dc9e154ce5fe471b8607a69cede8f7b7
msgid ""
"The Node is the base Node type which all other Nodes inherit from, it "
"only stores a Transform."
msgstr "節點是所有其他節點所繼承的基礎節點。它只儲存變換之數據。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:11 93ab9a2099b14b76ae2546b605f1ec78
msgid ""
"The transform stored by a Node will be inherited by its children. As "
"such, children's position, rotation, scale and sorting index is relative "
"to their parent."
msgstr ""
"節點儲存之變換參數將會被其子節點所繼承。因此，子節點之位置、旋轉、縮放及"
"排序索引皆相對於其父節點。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:13 77ec71838eea41be92294cd8693ce7f1
msgid ""
"A translation of ``0, 0, 0`` will result in the child node being in the "
"center of its parent node."
msgstr "``0, 0, 0`` 的變形參數將會使子節點在其父節點的中心。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:23 05ffd636e16f4e62872505a56754b973
msgid ""
"If you put a Node at ``0, 0, 0``, then add a child Node at ``0, 0, 32`` "
"and rotate the parent around the Y axis, the child node will spin around "
"its parent!"
msgstr ""
"如果你放入一個位置在\\ ``0, 0, 0``\\的節點，然後新增一個子節點在\\ ``0, "
"0, 32``\\，接著沿著 Y 方向轉動父節點，子節點將會以其為中心轉動！"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:25 d3519fba5d824c09ac366ceb80970132
msgid "How cool is that? 🦊"
msgstr "酷吧？ 🦊"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:28 9419baa24f644859ba38c9e46af3577a
msgid "Translation"
msgstr "移動"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:30 fbd01b277f02400d837c3f655b3624d6
msgid ""
"Translation is a fancy mathematical word for \"position\", the "
"translation defines where the Node is in 3D space."
msgstr "移動為\\「位置」\\的數學化說法，定義節點在 3D 空間中的位置。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:34 97f99342533d4cb8ad831b99ae2db712
msgid "Lock to Root Node"
msgstr "鎖定至根節點"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:36 121e2c4254d54a4cb26590b7148a1103
msgid ""
"This option allows the translation, scale and rotation to be independent "
"of the parent. In this mode the node moves only based on the special "
"root node of the model."
msgstr ""
"此選項將會使節點的移動、縮放及旋轉從父節點中獨立出來。在此模式下，節點將"
"只依據特殊根節點移動。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:38 54ec10943ab9467fbf07523b892c0e9b
msgid ""
"This is useful if you have some static element you want to only move "
"when the model itself moves."
msgstr "若您有希望僅隨模型本體移動的靜態元件，此功能將非常實用。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:42 ffc3d9d890e24a9aa3603fe89b66ee96
msgid "Rotation"
msgstr "旋轉"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:44 1b89358968de4a30968c7218a2614259
msgid "The rotation of the Node in degrees in 3D space."
msgstr "以度 (Degree) 為單位，儲存此節點在 3D 空間中的旋轉度數。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:47 c1e4eb09e39546c992efcf84f7a34b65
msgid "Scale"
msgstr "縮放"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:49 579b080e917d4dccbebfcf97daede0b7
msgid ""
"The scale of the Node, as Nodes are generally 2D objects in 3D space you "
"can only scale them on the X and Y axis."
msgstr ""
"儲存此節點的縮放。節點通常是 2D 物件，因此在 3D 空間中只能依照 X 或 Y 方"
"向縮放。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:52 1ac35bcb5cf248609fde2c8f647300b9
msgid "Snap to Pixel"
msgstr "對齊像素"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:54 a33b1a520f9f4a0f90748c83a430f3d9
msgid "Snaps the Node to the nearest pixel when moving."
msgstr "當移動時，將節點與最相近的像素對齊。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:57 f846204043954ffea01e0ed696fce3f9
msgid "Sorting"
msgstr "排列"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:59 7d9b7bcbdf34401f8518b84a011a497c
msgid ""
"The sorting index of the Node, smaller (and negative) numbers are closer "
"to the camera, while bigger numbers are further away."
msgstr ""
"儲存此節點的排序索引，較小（及負）的數字較為靠近相機，相反的，較大的數字"
"距離相機較遠。"

#: ../../creator/nodes/node.rst:61 b28680a32345437da4aa2ac2290bc4f2
msgid "This value is used to define what Part is drawn in what order."
msgstr "此數值用於定義各部位的繪製順序。"
